From b9539df0335260c1b00b175d0fd5a9286943e200 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Grieve <agrieve@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2020 16:27:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] KitKat: revert upstream minSdk 21 bump (restore API 19)

Reversed form of chromium commit b9539df03352 ("Reland #3: Android:
Increase default_min_sdk_version 19 -> 21", June 2020). Apply this to
a Bromite 108 / Chromium 108 checkout to restore build-level support
for android:minSdkVersion=19 (KitKat). Runtime API gaps still need
individual patches; see README.md.

This reverts commit 67dc51dd00a3b9c3a0efb2853290cff1b0fea1d6.

Reason for reland: Added min_sdk_version to failed targets

TBR=agrieve  # reland

Bug: 1091919
